{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy\u2019s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy\u2019s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2425320?t=1754737438","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754737438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/a5e05f0c984cc8c72eaa8170487baf168283afbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754737438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/a5e05f0c984cc8c72eaa8170487baf168283afbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754737438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy\u2019s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy\u2019s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p>","developers":["tesakiza"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image"